---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Privacy Policy & Data Protection | Real BMI"
    description="Real BMI privacy and consent policy. Learn about client-side computing with no personal health data stored, GDPR & CCPA rights, and Google Consent Mode v2 implementation."
    canonicalURL="https://realbmicalculator.com/en/privacy-policy/"
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
      title="Privacy Policy"
      eyebrow="Your data, your privacy"
      description="Learn how Real BMI protects your input data and keeps all calculations private and secure."
      returnUrl="/en/"
      returnLabel="Home"
    >
      <div class="max-w-5xl space-y-8 prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg font-medium opacity-90">
        
        <!-- Privacy at a Glance (Quick Summary Card) -->
        <div class="not-prose p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--card)]/60 border border-[var(--border)]/60 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
                Privacy at a Glance
              </h2>
              <p class="text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)]">
                A quick summary of how Real BMI protects your personal privacy
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Zero Health Storage:</strong> Calculations run locally in your browser</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span><strong>No Accounts or Logins:</strong> Use all 23 health tools without registration</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span><strong>No Sale of Data:</strong> Health numbers are never sold or rented</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--foreground)] font-medium">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 text-base leading-none">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Cookie Control:</strong> Manage consent anytime via the footer</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Core Trust Proposition Callout -->
        <div class="not-prose p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--accent)]/5 border-l-4 border-[var(--accent)] text-[var(--foreground)] space-y-1">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase font-display font-bold tracking-wider text-[var(--accent)]">
            Our Core Privacy Standard
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold leading-relaxed">
            All calculations execute purely on the client side within your web browser.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed">
            Your height, weight, age, and waist numbers never leave your device and are never transmitted to remote servers or saved in databases.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal text-[var(--foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          At <strong>Real BMI</strong>, we believe personal privacy and health data security are fundamental rights. Our tools are built from the ground up on a client-side architecture where your biometric measurements remain exclusively under your control.
        </p>

        <!-- 1. Client-Side Processing & Zero Health Data Retention -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            1. Client-Side Processing & Zero Health Data Retention
          </h2>
          <p>
            We do not collect, intercept, store, or transmit your individual biometric measurements.
          </p>
          <p>
            When you enter your height, weight, age, waist circumference, or activity level, all mathematical formulas execute entirely inside your device's web browser using JavaScript.
          </p>
          <p>
            Because computation occurs locally, your entered data exists only in temporary browser memory while you view the page. When you close the tab, refresh the page, or clear your browser cache, all entered numbers are instantly erased.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Technical Server Logs & Hosting Infrastructure -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            2. Technical Server Logs & Hosting Infrastructure
          </h2>
          <p>
            Real BMI is statically generated and served globally via the Cloudflare Pages edge network. Standard edge server access logs record technical diagnostic data.
          </p>
          <p>
            This includes browser user-agent strings, operating systems, and high-level geolocation (country/city level) solely to prevent malicious automated traffic, mitigate DDoS attacks, and keep server response times fast.
          </p>
          <p>
            These operational logs contain zero health metrics and are strictly isolated from all calculator tools.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Digital Advertising & Google AdSense Disclosures -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            3. Digital Advertising & Google AdSense Disclosures
          </h2>
          <p>
            Real BMI is supported by digital advertising to keep all 23 health calculators free to access:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
            <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to our website or other sites on the Internet.</li>
            <li><strong>Opt-Out of Personalized Ads:</strong> You can turn off personalized advertising anytime via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Non-Personalized Delivery:</strong> If you decline personalized advertising, non-personalized contextual ads may still appear based on general page topics, without tracking cookies.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Google Consent Mode v2 & Cookie Preferences -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            4. Google Consent Mode v2 & Cookie Preferences
          </h2>
          <p>
            We respect your consent preferences through rigorous technical controls:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
            <li><strong>Consent Mode v2:</strong> We implement Google Consent Mode v2 with default denied states (<code>ad_storage: 'denied'</code>, <code>ad_user_data: 'denied'</code>, <code>ad_personalization: 'denied'</code>, <code>analytics_storage: 'denied'</code>). Non-essential cookies activate only after your explicit opt-in.</li>
            <li><strong>EEA & UK Certified CMP:</strong> For visitors in the European Economic Area (EEA), United Kingdom, and Switzerland, consent is gathered using an official Google-certified Consent Management Platform (Google Funding Choices CMP supporting IAB TCF v2.2).</li>
            <li><strong>Consent Revocation:</strong> You can update or revoke your cookie choices at any time by clicking "Cookie Preferences" in our website footer. Revoking consent immediately purges non-essential tracking cookies.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Your Legal Rights (GDPR & CCPA) -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            5. Your Legal Rights (GDPR & CCPA)
          </h2>
          <p>
            Whether you reside in the European Union, California, or worldwide, you hold clear rights over your privacy:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
            <li><strong>No Sale of Data:</strong> Real BMI does not sell, rent, monetize, or trade personal health numbers to data brokers.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to Deletion:</strong> Because all calculations execute locally and zero health records are kept on servers, your data is deleted by design upon session end.</li>
            <li><strong>Preferences Control:</strong> You can inspect and update your cookie choices anytime using our interactive <a href="/en/cookie-policy/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Cookie Policy</a> center.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Website Security & TLS Encryption -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            6. Website Security & TLS Encryption
          </h2>
          <p>
            Our website uses modern Transport Layer Security (TLS 1.3) encryption, strict HTTP headers, and client-side isolation to keep your browsing session private, secure, and protected against unauthorized interception.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Children's Privacy Protection -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            7. Children's Privacy Protection
          </h2>
          <p>
            Real BMI is designed for a general adult audience. We do not knowingly collect or request personal information from children under 13 (or under 16 in the European Union).
          </p>
          <p>
            Pediatric calculators (such as teen growth percentiles) are informational guides intended for use under the supervision of a parent, guardian, or qualified healthcare professional.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Data Controller & Contact Information -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            8. Data Controller & Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p>
            Real BMI is an independent website created and maintained by <strong>Bhawanshi Dosi</strong> (Banswara, Rajasthan, India).
          </p>
          <p>
            If you have questions about our privacy practices, browser calculation engine, or cookie settings, please contact us via our <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Contact Us Page</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
